WEBVTT

00:23.410 --> 00:30.380
It's right before your eyes... Just a little more...

00:30.630 --> 00:35.470
Your dream is right there.

00:36.180 --> 00:41.390
Only a small hunch...

00:41.640 --> 00:45.480
...keeps your hopes up now.

00:45.730 --> 00:50.860
In this endless, dark maze,

00:50.980 --> 00:54.990
strength is realizing...

00:55.740 --> 00:57.780
...your own weakness.

00:57.780 --> 01:01.120
Taking in the shining wind,

01:01.120 --> 01:06.120
you can fly...

01:06.620 --> 01:08.880
...towards the vast sky.

01:11.920 --> 01:15.970
When even the deepest darkness turns into light...

01:16.050 --> 01:23.560
...I believe in that instant.

01:24.230 --> 01:27.810
I'll keep on believing...

01:57.090 --> 02:02.180
<i>Families are just individuals who are blood-related.</i>

02:02.180 --> 02:06.430
<i>I don't care and neither do they.</i>

02:06.430 --> 02:07.850
<i>That's not true!</i>

02:10.190 --> 02:11.730
That's...!

02:15.400 --> 02:18.150
<i>That boy doesn't have much longer to live.</i>

02:18.150 --> 02:22.240
<i>However, his life is being prolonged by the Demon that's possessing him.</i>

02:22.240 --> 02:25.290
<i>In other words, if you seal the Demon,</i>

02:25.290 --> 02:28.120
he will die.

02:30.120 --> 02:34.000
<i>If it's not a dream, then please! Let me fly!</i>

02:35.340 --> 02:36.840
<i>Zen-kun.</i>

02:36.840 --> 02:39.630
Zen-kun!

02:45.260 --> 02:46.640
Checkmate!

02:52.810 --> 02:55.150
I won't let you <i>Checkmate</i> Zen-kun!

02:56.150 --> 02:57.900
I heard you scream.

02:58.740 --> 03:01.740
So, I got worried and barged in!

03:10.790 --> 03:15.290
Decision?! Checkmate of Sorrow

03:16.630 --> 03:19.170
Zen? Him?

03:19.170 --> 03:20.800
I knew there was something...

03:20.800 --> 03:26.640
So, if I <i>Checkmate</i> the Demon that's possessing Zen-kun right now, his life will be in danger.

03:26.640 --> 03:28.720
But a Demon is a Demon.

03:28.720 --> 03:30.350
We can't just let it go.

03:30.350 --> 03:32.730
What's important is Zen-kun's life!

03:32.730 --> 03:35.400
I want him to be happy.

03:35.400 --> 03:38.570
Even if it's a life brought forth by a Demon?

03:41.740 --> 03:45.830
A person that is possessed by a Demon eventually becomes a Demon.

03:45.830 --> 03:46.950
Is that okay?

03:46.950 --> 03:48.580
It's not okay!!

03:48.580 --> 03:53.580
But he closed his heart while separated from his parents...

03:53.580 --> 03:57.800
...and I don't want him to think that's normal!

03:59.380 --> 04:01.420
That's why...

04:01.420 --> 04:04.140
That's why I want Zen-kun to change!

04:09.100 --> 04:09.930
Please.

04:09.930 --> 04:11.100
Thank you.

04:25.240 --> 04:26.910
Zen-kun's mother!

04:29.790 --> 04:31.870
- Stop acting on your own!

04:33.460 --> 04:35.290
"Stop acting...?!"

04:35.290 --> 04:38.500
This comes from the guy who ran off in the middle of his IV?!

04:38.500 --> 04:40.670
I don't need that thing!

04:40.670 --> 04:42.300
Let me go!

04:42.300 --> 04:44.180
Are you trying to escape again?

04:44.180 --> 04:44.930
What?!

04:45.430 --> 04:46.890
I told you to never come back!

04:48.050 --> 04:50.180
I never said I wouldn't!

04:54.770 --> 04:57.060
Thank you very much.

04:57.060 --> 04:59.440
You're not going to see Zen-kun?

05:01.280 --> 05:03.610
Why? Why are you so...

05:04.360 --> 05:06.200
I can't see him right now!

05:06.200 --> 05:08.070
It's better that I don't!

05:08.070 --> 05:10.160
But Zen-kun will be...

05:10.160 --> 05:12.290
Um, I will be leaving now.

05:12.290 --> 05:14.910
I can't leave the store alone any longer.

05:24.920 --> 05:26.380
Why did you come?

05:26.380 --> 05:29.430
Because I'm interested in you.

05:33.470 --> 05:35.980
You said that you wanted to fly.

05:38.770 --> 05:40.190
H-Hey!

05:40.190 --> 05:41.650
Where would you go?

05:42.530 --> 05:44.110
If you could really fly.

05:45.610 --> 05:47.700
<i>If I could really fly...</i>

05:52.870 --> 05:55.040
Zen is a nice name.

05:56.250 --> 06:01.840
Did you know that your name is the first love you receive from your parents?

06:05.550 --> 06:06.510
H-Hey!

06:07.590 --> 06:10.340
What are you planning to do?

06:10.340 --> 06:12.890
You want to fly out of here, don't you?

06:14.680 --> 06:17.140
My, you're quite early today.

06:17.140 --> 06:20.900
Y-Yes, I just got a huge load!

06:21.860 --> 06:24.030
I'm getting on! I'm getting on!

06:31.120 --> 06:33.910
Hey, are you serious about sneaking me out?!

06:44.380 --> 06:45.050
Let's go!

06:45.050 --> 06:45.760
H-Hey!

06:46.920 --> 06:48.880
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

06:48.880 --> 06:50.930
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

06:50.930 --> 06:52.470
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

06:52.470 --> 06:54.140
What the heck is that?!

06:54.140 --> 06:55.770
The magic spell of flight!

06:55.770 --> 06:56.770
What?!

06:56.770 --> 06:58.850
Everyone has wings, you know.

07:00.770 --> 07:03.270
Wings that can take you anywhere.

07:03.270 --> 07:05.610
Wings that can take you anywhere...

07:14.330 --> 07:15.830
Hey, this doesn't look good!

07:18.580 --> 07:20.580
Please get on, I'll drive you.

07:21.960 --> 07:23.460
Hiriji-sensei...

07:37.220 --> 07:39.020
A-Are you...!

07:39.020 --> 07:40.940
Exactly.

07:40.940 --> 07:42.400
We're going to your place.

07:42.400 --> 07:44.560
H-Hold on!

07:45.400 --> 07:47.150
I can't...!

07:47.940 --> 07:54.820
I don't want to see them and neither do they! I just know it!

07:55.530 --> 08:00.200
You're scared to think that your parents actually feel that way.

08:00.200 --> 08:02.160
T-That's not...

08:03.210 --> 08:09.260
Isn't it better to regret something you've done, rather than to regret something you haven't done?

08:11.550 --> 08:13.180
Right, Zen-kun?

08:13.180 --> 08:15.640
B-But...

08:15.640 --> 08:17.300
What am I going to do?

08:18.010 --> 08:20.430
Go right into their face!

08:20.430 --> 08:22.310
T-To who?

08:22.310 --> 08:23.810
Your parents!

08:23.810 --> 08:25.270
Who's going to go...?

08:31.240 --> 08:34.160
Welcome. Oh!

08:34.160 --> 08:36.950
You bought flowers the other day!

08:37.660 --> 08:39.080
Mom!

08:39.080 --> 08:40.750
Now, muster up your courage!

08:40.750 --> 08:42.870
W-What am I going to say?!

08:42.870 --> 08:45.040
We've come all this way here.

08:45.040 --> 08:47.330
I-I was forced here!

08:47.330 --> 08:48.540
Geez...

08:49.630 --> 08:52.340
What kind of flowers are you looking for today?

08:52.340 --> 08:55.180
Oh, no. I'm not looking for flowers today.

08:56.720 --> 09:00.180
Um, you are Zen-kun's mother, aren't you?

09:00.180 --> 09:02.680
My! Are you Zen-kun's friend?

09:02.680 --> 09:06.940
Yes, my name is Kusakabe Maron. Uh...

09:06.940 --> 09:09.440
You visit the hospital every day, right?

09:09.440 --> 09:12.280
Why won't you go see Zen-kun?

09:13.320 --> 09:14.650
Why?

09:15.990 --> 09:18.700
Zen...Zen told you this...?

09:19.450 --> 09:20.950
N-No.

09:21.950 --> 09:24.540
I'm sorry for intruding like this.

09:24.540 --> 09:28.460
However, if you have any reasons, I want you to tell him!

09:29.340 --> 09:35.510
That's why Zen-kun is always lonely. So insecure...

09:35.510 --> 09:37.590
I want to see him, too!

09:39.050 --> 09:40.890
I've always wanted to see him!

09:40.890 --> 09:43.390
I want to talk to him and hug him!

09:44.730 --> 09:47.390
Then, why?! Why is it that...?!

09:48.400 --> 09:50.310
Zen is a kind child.

09:50.310 --> 09:53.070
He's the type that smiles even though he's suffering.

09:53.070 --> 09:57.490
If we go see him, it would be putting pressure on him...!

09:57.490 --> 09:59.200
That's why we can't see him.

09:59.200 --> 10:03.040
Our wish isn't just to see Zen...

10:03.040 --> 10:07.160
...it's for him to show us his true smile!

10:08.790 --> 10:09.880
Mom...

10:21.180 --> 10:23.390
Have you forgotten our agreement?

10:26.310 --> 10:33.940
That if you ever were to fill your soul with love, your heart will stop.

10:38.610 --> 10:40.700
Have you forgotten?!

10:43.780 --> 10:47.540
Have you forgotten our agreement?!

10:48.120 --> 10:50.080
Y-You're...!

10:57.760 --> 10:59.050
Hijiri-sensei...

11:15.270 --> 11:16.940
Hang in there, Zen-kun!

11:24.910 --> 11:28.540
Don't... Don't tell them...

11:29.710 --> 11:32.000
I don't want to show them...

11:32.000 --> 11:33.790
...this body!

12:03.200 --> 12:05.820
How can I, Zen-kun?

12:05.820 --> 12:08.200
Just quit, Maron.

12:08.200 --> 12:11.790
This is all the work of a Demon.

12:11.790 --> 12:12.710
Chiaki.

12:13.920 --> 12:15.710
The only thing left to do is to <i>Checkmate!</i>

12:15.710 --> 12:17.170
<i>Checkmate...</i>

12:18.170 --> 12:20.380
But what about Zen-kun?

12:20.380 --> 12:22.170
What about Zen-kun's life?

12:22.170 --> 12:23.630
Don't get involved!

12:23.630 --> 12:26.930
I can't bear to watch you hurt yourself anymore!

12:32.690 --> 12:33.850
M-Maron!

12:37.110 --> 12:37.900
<i>Noin!</i>

12:39.230 --> 12:41.320
<i>You were deceiving Zen-kun!</i>

12:43.450 --> 12:45.610
<i>You acted like you gave him life...</i>

12:46.780 --> 12:48.030
<i>I won't forgive you!</i>

12:52.200 --> 12:53.080
<i>Noin!</i>

12:54.870 --> 12:56.380
I'm going to defeat you!

12:57.710 --> 13:01.380
What you are doing is pointless.

13:08.720 --> 13:11.890
Rather than gaining love, he chose to gain life.

13:11.890 --> 13:14.640
It is a destiny of his own choosing.

13:15.440 --> 13:19.270
And he was the one that broke the agreement.

13:19.270 --> 13:20.440
How horrible!

13:20.440 --> 13:23.280
Your goal was to make Zen-kun suffer!

13:24.450 --> 13:25.360
No.

13:26.240 --> 13:28.280
It's just the life of a mere human.

13:28.280 --> 13:31.120
He is none of my concern.

13:31.120 --> 13:32.870
My goal...

13:35.830 --> 13:38.580
...is you, Jeanne!

13:40.750 --> 13:42.920
<i>Fin, lend me you power!</i>

13:42.920 --> 13:45.550
<i>Deliver my wish to Jeanne d'Arc!</i>

14:06.860 --> 14:09.070
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

14:09.070 --> 14:11.530
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

14:11.530 --> 14:13.240
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

14:19.830 --> 14:23.590
<i>Kaitou Jeanne has arrived by the order of God!</i>

14:28.930 --> 14:30.510
I don't understand...

14:30.510 --> 14:34.930
If there really is a God, what does He want me to do?

14:34.930 --> 14:36.730
There is a God!

14:42.690 --> 14:44.480
That is the truth.

14:46.990 --> 14:51.160
However, there are only three things that God can do:

14:51.160 --> 14:52.490
<i>Three?</i>

14:53.660 --> 14:56.830
First, create souls.

14:56.830 --> 15:00.620
Second, watch over those souls.

15:00.620 --> 15:05.090
Third, control the Earth's environment.

15:05.090 --> 15:06.920
Have you forgotten?

15:06.920 --> 15:08.840
Jeanne d'Arc...

15:09.930 --> 15:13.430
Have you forgotten, Jeanne d'Arc?!

15:24.150 --> 15:27.480
I knew you were not Jeanne d'Arc!

15:28.570 --> 15:32.660
I will no longer tolerate the soul of Jeanne d'Arc being desecrated!

15:32.660 --> 15:33.450
Noin!

15:34.910 --> 15:37.700
You have no right to be Jeanne!

16:00.480 --> 16:02.020
Noin? Where are you?!

16:02.020 --> 16:03.060
Come out!

16:03.060 --> 16:03.770
Noin!

16:11.110 --> 16:12.030
Go.

16:19.120 --> 16:20.200
Right there!

16:20.200 --> 16:21.500
<i>Checkmate!</i>

16:25.080 --> 16:26.750
Zen-kun! You...

16:27.670 --> 16:29.670
"Strong and serious..."

16:33.550 --> 16:35.720
"Matchless and marvelous..."

16:36.680 --> 16:38.430
"Energetic and..."

16:39.930 --> 16:42.230
Energetic and...courageous.

16:49.860 --> 16:51.780
Maron, please.

16:51.780 --> 16:54.070
My...heart...

16:55.240 --> 16:59.410
My... My heart!!!

17:00.240 --> 17:01.790
Steal it!

17:05.040 --> 17:07.210
Please, Maron!

17:07.210 --> 17:11.050
I can't! If I do, you'll...

17:11.050 --> 17:12.510
I can't handle it...

17:12.510 --> 17:18.680
Living a lie isn't... It isn't living at all!

17:18.680 --> 17:19.640
So...!

17:22.470 --> 17:25.190
So... My heart...

17:29.980 --> 17:31.980
Sinbad!

17:37.320 --> 17:39.280
Jeanne, stop!

17:52.170 --> 17:53.550
I told you!

17:53.550 --> 17:56.840
A person possessed by a Demon eventually becomes a Demon!

17:56.840 --> 17:59.680
Zen-kun... Zen-kun isn't a Demon!

17:59.680 --> 18:02.100
But he'll be one soon!

18:03.770 --> 18:06.270
That... That won't happen!

18:06.980 --> 18:09.810
I think it is about time.

18:10.270 --> 18:11.400
Come out!

18:18.570 --> 18:19.280
Zen-kun!

18:29.710 --> 18:31.040
<i>Checkmate!</i>

18:35.590 --> 18:36.970
J-Jeanne...

18:37.800 --> 18:41.220
Are you saying that even his feelings...

18:41.220 --> 18:43.260
That Zen-kun's feelings are from the Demon?!

18:44.430 --> 18:46.770
J-Jeanne!!!

18:46.770 --> 18:48.770
Will you give up love?

18:48.770 --> 18:51.900
Or will you give up life?!

19:02.490 --> 19:04.620
<i>I want to see him, too!</i>

19:05.490 --> 19:07.200
<i>I've always wanted to see him!</i>

19:07.200 --> 19:09.960
<i>I want to talk to him and hug him!</i>

19:13.750 --> 19:17.670
<i>If we go see him, it would be putting pressure on him...!</i>

19:17.670 --> 19:19.260
<i>That's why we can't see him...</i>

19:19.260 --> 19:23.470
<i>Our wish isn't just to see Zen...</i>

19:23.470 --> 19:27.680
<i>...it's for him to show us his true smile!</i>

19:29.020 --> 19:31.600
I won't give you my love or my life!

19:38.690 --> 19:39.650
Zen-kun...!

19:41.280 --> 19:44.950
M-Maron, you are my wind.

19:44.950 --> 19:48.290
I was able to become stronger because of you!

19:49.160 --> 19:50.040
Zen-kun!

19:50.500 --> 19:52.170
From now on...!

19:53.380 --> 19:55.000
I'm going to live...

19:55.000 --> 19:56.840
...with my own strength!

19:57.210 --> 19:58.210
Zen-kun...

20:01.550 --> 20:02.970
<i>Checkmate!</i>

20:26.320 --> 20:28.830
Thank you. I'll be fine from here.

20:28.830 --> 20:30.500
I'll go the rest of the way on my own.

20:32.290 --> 20:33.500
O-Okay...

20:40.590 --> 20:42.840
Welcome!

20:47.350 --> 20:51.060
Mom, Dad... I wanted to see you.

20:51.600 --> 20:52.930
Is it really...

20:53.770 --> 20:54.690
Zen?

20:55.900 --> 20:57.360
Zen, you...

20:57.810 --> 20:59.360
I wanted to see you!

21:00.940 --> 21:03.990
Zen! What are you doing at this hour?!

21:03.990 --> 21:06.110
Are you all right, Zen?

21:06.110 --> 21:08.870
I wanted to see you. I wanted to show my face!

21:08.870 --> 21:10.790
That's...that's all!

21:11.450 --> 21:12.330
Zen...

21:14.410 --> 21:16.040
So warm...

21:16.670 --> 21:17.580
Mom...

21:30.930 --> 21:33.520
<i>Thank you, truly...</i>

21:34.890 --> 21:35.980
<i>Thank you.</i>

21:39.400 --> 21:40.980
Thank you...

21:45.240 --> 21:47.700
God, please tell me.

21:48.370 --> 21:50.740
If You can create souls...

21:51.490 --> 21:54.160
...for what purpose was Zen-kun born?

21:56.750 --> 22:00.040
Was Zen-kun able to return back to You?

22:09.090 --> 22:10.010
Wind?

22:15.140 --> 22:19.100
In essence, the only thing that God gives is...

22:20.440 --> 22:23.980
...despair!

22:28.610 --> 22:35.250
The thick clouds past and the descending light...

22:36.000 --> 22:44.630
...slowly melts the hardened, damaged past.

22:45.260 --> 22:49.130
Because we live so stiffly,

22:49.130 --> 22:52.850
it's so easy to smash into pieces.

22:53.050 --> 23:01.980
And I never thought that I had anything to protect...

23:02.520 --> 23:05.690
Never forgetting...

23:05.980 --> 23:09.820
...there is unending love.

23:10.530 --> 23:14.580
I'll catch it, I'll steal it.

23:14.780 --> 23:17.870
Then embrace you with it.

23:18.160 --> 23:21.080
Even if there comes a time...

23:21.580 --> 23:26.050
...when this planet is destroyed,

23:26.250 --> 23:30.090
I won't be lonely, I won't be alone.

23:30.340 --> 23:37.890
I'll be embracing an eternal wind.

23:47.980 --> 23:53.530
As long as you live, your parents will continue to hate you.

23:53.530 --> 23:54.570
What do you mean?!

23:54.570 --> 23:57.740
Jeanne, entrust me with your soul.

23:57.740 --> 24:02.000
The souls of your parents are within the hand of the Devil.

24:03.500 --> 24:07.800
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne:  Only One Wish! To Father and Mother

24:07.800 --> 24:13.930
Your parents were both possessed by Demons before you were born.
